{"title":"Pale Hart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/pale-hart\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>38</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>19</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>38</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/pale-hart?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>19</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 7 recorded drops, 1,352 total, 142–223 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×142–223</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 4 of 5 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 21 total, 4–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×4–6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-arms\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Arms - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1f32ba4ba4496e9683bd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-torso\" title=\"Gravewrap Torso - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/612eb1b2115c7c63ce78.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-feet\" title=\"Glimmerfox Feet - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/6e15349c74d396797513.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mothsilk-feet\" title=\"Mothsilk Feet - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e324bfa37a4979ed76fa.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mothsilk Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-legs\" title=\"Dragonhide Legs - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab4bfdde0dada9a875e7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Moonfane</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 67</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6103\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-pale-hart\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/e2e0b9d15c65806fed4f.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>The Pale Hart</b><span>Lv 42–57</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Moonbeast: <a href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">Glimmerfox</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/moonhart\">Moonhart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/white-unicorn\">White Unicorn</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7368d760ade781ef7459.svg\" alt=\"Pale Hart\"></div><h3>Pale Hart</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>42 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 42–57)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Moonbeast</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>212</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>7 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}